1. &#91; <code>N&#58;M</code> &#93;연관관계, &#91; <code>1&#58;N</code>, <code>M&#58;1</code> &#93; 연관관계로 재설계
    > Item ↔ Category ( <code>N&#58;M</code>)  ⇒ Item ↔ ItemCategory ↔ Category (<code>1&#58;N</code>, <code>M&#58;1</code>)

